data: {"type":"thought","content":"已为你生成静态任务计划：\n\n1. 合同文档智能审查与合规诊断 - Skill: platform.document.contract-reviewer@1.0.2 (workflow)\n\n执行单 ID: `e0994a5e-27b7-4d00-8128-df3806c1b5a9`。正在跟踪流程执行状态...\n","data":{"executionId":"e0994a5e-27b7-4d00-8128-df3806c1b5a9","status":"running","deterministicPlan":{"objective":"请对附件这一份合同进行合同审查，我方为甲方（买方）。请逐条阅读全部语言的正文，重点检查我方义务、责任、数据或知识产权、付款和退出安排，生成完整合同审查报告。请以中文回复。","nodes":[{"nodeId":"n1_合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","sequence":1,"title":"合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","kind":"skill","skillId":"platform.document.contract-reviewer","skillVersion":"1.0.2","runtimeType":"workflow","executionRuntimeType":"workflow","dependsOn":[],"inputBindings":{"fileUrl":{"source":"user_input","path":"fileUrl"},"fileName":{"source":"user_input","path":"fileName"},"fileBase64":{"source":"user_input","path":"fileBase64"},"downloadUrl":{"source":"user_input","path":"downloadUrl"},"contractType":{"source":"user_input","path":"contractType"},"myPosition":{"source":"literal","value":"甲方"},"reviewPrompt":{"source":"literal","value":"请逐条阅读全部语言的正文，重点检查我方义务、责任、数据或知识产权、付款和退出安排，生成完整合同审查报告。"}},"outputContract":{"clauses":"json","metrics":"json","summary":"string","artifact":"artifact_ref","artifacts":"json","htmlReport":"string","myPosition":"string","contractType":"string","missingClauses":"json","contractTypeName":"string"},"failurePolicy":"abort","modelId":"d13e0d30-87b9-4e87-b96a-d8b1b3cf78af"}],"finalOutputs":[{"targetField":"result","fromNodeId":"n1_合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","fromNodeOutput":"artifact","expectedType":"artifact_ref","isArtifact":true},{"targetField":"summary","fromNodeId":"n1_合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","fromNodeOutput":"summary","expectedType":"string","isArtifact":false}]},"traceId":"f52dc4a2-d9ae-4336-bf93-4f63b376e732"},"seq":4,"protocolVersion":"1","sessionId":"corpus-CT01-zh-txt-1792243170664","traceId":"f52dc4a2-d9ae-4336-bf93-4f63b376e732"}

